**架构决策：未读汇总由前端本地计算**

**❌ 已移除：获取未读汇总API**
- **原API**：`POST /api/v1/protected/user/get_unread_summary`
- **改为**：前端基于聊天列表和通知列表本地统计
- **理由**：
  - 前端已维护每个聊天的未读计数（通过API和WebSocket）
  - 通知未读数通过 `POST /api/v1/protected/inbox/get_unread_count` 获取
  - 汇总计算非常简单，无需后端支持
- **前端实现**：
  ```typescript
  // 在前端 Store 中计算
  const unreadSummary = computed(() => {
    const messages = chatStore.privateChats.reduce((sum, c) => sum + c.unread_count, 0)
                   + chatStore.groupChats.reduce((sum, c) => sum + c.unread_count, 0);
    const notifications = inboxStore.unreadCount;
    const friend_requests = userStore.friendRequests.filter(r => r.status === 'pending').length;
    const group_invites = groupStore.invites.filter(i => i.status === 'pending').length;
    
    return { messages, friend_requests, group_invites, notifications };
  });
  ```

